==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a [[fund]] [[deposited]] by a [[customer]] (the depositor) in a bank from which they can make [[withdrawal]]s
# the [[formal]] [[relationship]] established between the [[depositor]] and the bank
# a [[statement]] [[summarizing]] [[credit]] and [[debit]] [[transaction]]s with the account

